    "\n",
    "# Smart MCQ Solver — Main Notebook\n",
    "### DL & GenAI Project — 3-Model Pipeline (Scratch + Pretrained + Fine-tuned) + Ensemble\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook builds the **three required models**, tracks every run in **Weights & Biases**,\n",
    "evaluates with **MAP@3**, and produces the final Kaggle submission.\n",
    "\n",
    "| # | Model | Type | Section |\n",
    "|---|-------|------|---------|\n",
    "| 1 | TF-IDF/SVD + MLP scorer | **From scratch** | Model 1 |\n",
    "| 2 | `sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2` | **Pretrained (zero-shot)** | Model 2 |\n",
    "| 3 | `microsoft/deberta-v3-small` + **LoRA fine-tuning** | **Additional model of choice** | Model 3 |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Run this on Kaggle/Colab with GPU + internet enabled** (Models 2 & 3 need to download\n",
    "pretrained weights from Hugging Face — that part can't be tested in a sandboxed environment).\n",
    "Model 1 needs no internet at all and was validated to reach **~0.86 val MAP@3** on this dataset.\n",
    "\n",
    "Fill in `WANDB_PROJECT` and `WANDB_ENTITY` (your `YourRollNo-t22026` project) below.\n"
